(card "exp:G-R2-2_luoyangchan_cap5M" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:G-R2-2_luoyangchan_cap5M"
  :body "---\nnav: 30\ntype: experiment\nid: G-R2-2_luoyangchan_cap5M\nshort_name: luoyangchan_cap5M\ntitle: \"G-R2-2 — 洛阳铲 solo, baseline_max_avg = 5.0M\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: g\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_g__source_swap]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0314\ntrain_trade_count: 70\ntrain_win_rate: 0.5571\ntrain_sharpe: 1.8537\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0090\nval_nav_mean: 1.0021\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0071\nval_window_count: 10\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: demoted\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [source_swap]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/g, round/r2, axis/source_swap, status/demoted, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# G-R2-2 — 洛阳铲 + cap 5M\n\n> **TL;DR** —— cap 再放宽到 5M (≈4× anchor default)。trade_count 升到 70 但 win 55.7% / sharpe 1.85 —— cap 越宽 NAV 越差。confirm 洛阳铲 source 在大 cap 下 alpha 反而稀释。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 继续放宽 cap 看是否能恢复 anchor-scale 数字。\n- 实测：sample 增但 quality 大幅降 (win 64→56%)。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 G-R2-1, cap = 5M. 84 笔 post-cap.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0314 | 70 | 1.85 | 55.7% | -0.90% |\n| Val (10w) | 1.0021 ± 0.007 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0 nominal, 但 win 55% near coin-flip; 实质 fail。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-1__luoyangchan_cap26M]]\n- **same_axis**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-3__luoyangchan_nocap]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_g/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (G-R2-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- cap relaxation curve: win 74% (cap 1.3M default) → 64% (2.6M) → 56% (5M) → ~52% (no cap)。说明 cap 是 quality filter, source 本身在 cap 之外没 alpha。\n"
